{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50245","headline":"百步桥 · 李翔","name":"百步桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亘险凌虚百步桥，古应从此上千（干）霄。\n（「古应」，项疑当作「故应」。\n）不辞宛转峰千仞，且喜分明路一条。\n银汉攀缘知必到，月宫斟酌去非遥。\n牵牛漫更劳乌鹊，岁岁填河绿顶爑（焦）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}